    "body": "> So this is basically saving the web developer from typing / video.playbackRate? \r\n\r\nNot just that, but for the end user the timeline shall reflect accordingly. \r\n\r\n<img width=\"1089\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/18315/200974262-74fa32f2-a7ff-4cf9-adec-dad4e32a6ac2.png\">\r\n\r\n^ here the `start/end` time should reflect accordingly based on the playbackRate.\r\n\r\nCan be for audio/video.\r\n\r\n",
