    "body": "Well, changing the user experience of how video controls are displayed is not governed by standards. I suspect the UX teams at each browser have already made decisions on whether it's best to show the \"wall clock\" time remaining or the \"video length\" time remaining, but if you think they've made the wrong decisions, the best place to discuss that is the bug tracker for each browser.",
